# AI stack (basecoat-ui-mcp)

Inherits global: `~/.cursor/rules/token-efficiency-stack.mdc`, `~/.cursor/rules/openviking-core.mdc`.

Session start/close: see project `ai-stack.mdc` or `index.mdc` when present.

## Ops loop

- One change -> verify -> closeout

## Retrieval order

| Priority | Tool | Rule |
|----------|------|------|
| Code structure | `codebase-memory-mcp` | before grep loops |
| Memory L0.5 | `get_context_fragments(max_tokens=700, limit=3)` | before broad search |
| Memory L1 | `search_memory(limit=3)` | one project scope only |
| Docs | neuledge `get_docs` -> local runbooks -> Context7 if empty | max 3/turn |
| Shell | RTK-compressed | logs <=120 lines |

## OpenViking

- Cursor: official `openviking` plugin (no per-repo duplicate). agy/Grok: global `openviking-adapter` only.
- Canonical writer: Netcup tunnel `http://127.0.0.1:1935` only; homelab OpenViking is stopped (rollback only).
- Writes: one closeout `add_memory` only; `extraction_enabled=false`; `OPENVIKING_DUAL_WRITE=0`
- Scope: `project: "basecoat-ui-mcp"` on every memory call; no cross-session injection
- Legacy skip: check `retrieval_l05` in `@github/ai/infra/openviking/memory-domains.json`
- Runbook: `@github/ai/docs/runbooks/openviking-hybrid-workstation.md`

## Write format

```
[project=basecoat-ui-mcp] [git=<path>] <distilled fact>
DOCS: runbook <path> | get_docs(<lib@latest>, topic="<kw>")
```

Never store secrets, raw `.env`, or full logs.

## Steady state

Do **not** re-run `project:stack:bootstrap:all` unless drift. Re-bootstrap one repo: `npm run project:stack:bootstrap -- /var/home/zygis/@github/basecoat-ui-mcp` from `@github/ai`.
